{"id":"613869","name":"凉拌无骨鸭掌","author":"四月豆","authorId":"10674111","desc":"","cover":"images/613869/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭爪","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备的食材。","img":"images/613869/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"少许料酒加姜，放入清水中煮至冒泡，加入鸭爪。","img":"images/613869/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮沸腾5分钟左右。","img":"images/613869/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出来过凉水或冰水。","img":"images/613869/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"沥干水份后，加入辣椒、蒜泥、姜、酱油、食盐、白糖。","img":"images/613869/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再加入陈醋、米醋、香油、凉开水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/613869/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"密封放冰箱保鲜4个小时左右。","img":"images/613869/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/613869/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}